<title>SINGAPORE: Teck Wah Paper 1st-half net down 69 pct.</title>
<headline>Teck Wah Paper 1st-half net down 69 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.22  vs   0.69</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    0.19  vs   0.61</p>
<p>    Turnover				27.01  vs  24.64</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   0.46  vs   0.28</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortization	  2.15  vs   2.01</p>
<p>    Tax					0.55  vs   0.43</p>
<p>    Minorities		    (loss) 0.16  vs   0.04 (loss)</p>
<p>Note - Teck Wah Paper Products Ltd designs and makes printed packaging boxes. -- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
